governed only by a separate signed agreement.

5. No warranty

THE MATERIALS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" FOR EVALUATION. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT
PERMITTED BY LAW, SUREFORM DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED,
INCLUDING MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND
NON-INFRINGEMENT.

6. Termination

This license terminates automatically upon breach and may be revoked by
